WEBVTT

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:09.900
Did you bring the goods?

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:13.490
Of course. I've got the best stuff around.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.740
And did you bring what you promised?

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.620
Naturally!

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:17.990
All right, then.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.370
Top-Quality Banana            Top-Quality Bone

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.730
Now hand over yours.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:22.270
Sure!

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:23.120
One second.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.120
<b>Monkey                  Dog</b>

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:24.120
Here!

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.120
<b>Sol/Lull Seals</b>

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.250
You two!

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.150
Quit slacking off and get back to work...

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.340
<b>Sol/Lull Seals</b>

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.520
What?! You guys aren't plannin' to trade

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:33.880
Top-Quality Banana            Top-Quality Bone

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.760
your Sol/Lull seals for those, are ya?!

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:36.370
Huh?

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:37.040
That's bad?

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:41.530
My brains are made different 
from other Eto-musume's!

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:43.580
Yeah, they're made dumber, right?

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.460
They're the perfect model of stupidity!

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.290
What?! Well, you guys are 
just made of rudeness!

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.400
Nya-tan, look here...

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.090
Just so ya know,

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:58.090
gettin' Sol/Lull Seals that way 
won't get ya into the zodiac.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:00.410
Yep! I know!

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:03.930
Is that how ya show remorse?!

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.650
Yes, Master. I understand.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.250
You'd better.

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:10.450
Honestly...

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:14.140
Ha, ha! Scaredy-cat!

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.630
I can't help it.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.890
Yeah, she is your master in 
strength and techniques.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:20.010
She's seriously scary!

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:20.680
Uh-oh!

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.640
Hey!

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.060
Hold it right there!

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:26.810
Scary!

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:30.870
This ain't good.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.840
This ain't good at all.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:56.670
<b>ETOTAMA</b>

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:19.260
<b>Episode 6: The Three Laughers 
of the Tiger's Scheme</b>

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:23.020
Thanks. Sorry to put ya to the trouble.

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:23.890
It's okay.

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:27.100
So what did you want to talk about?

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.810
It's about Nya-tan.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.100
Okay...

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.830
You might... not...

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.990
have noticed, but...

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.740
It's okay. You can spit out the squid.

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:43.110
No, I can't do that.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:46.850
You... grilled this... for me...

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.640
I must finish it... gratefully.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.830
You're very serious about 
these things, huh?

00:03:57.310 --> 00:04:00.450
Anyway, you might not have noticed, but...

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.260
Yeah?

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:04.220
Nya-tan will never join the 
Chinese zodiac at this rate.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.110
Probably not.

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:07.430
What? When did ya realize it?

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:09.130
Quite a while ago.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:12.170
L-Looks like I underestimated ya a bit.

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:13.770
That'll make this quick.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.690
Eto-musume earn gratitude from 
humans through good conduct

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.360
and grow by collecting their Sol/Lull.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.500
But...

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:25.500
I've never seen Nya-tan do anything 
I'd call "good conduct."

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:29.750
That's because the quality of 
your Sol/Lull is too high...

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:30.890
I think.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:31.540
Huh?

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.700
Just a tiny bit makes her crazy strong.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.210
Since she feels at ease knowin' such 
convenient Sol/Lull is nearby...

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:41.840
No, since she knows she can just 
steal some if she needs to,

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.850
she's not makin' any effort anymore.

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:48.850
That's true... I've never seen 
her make any effort, either.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.620
At this rate, not only will she

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:54.020
never join the zodiac, 
but Chu-tan will destroy her.

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:55.560
Chu-tan...

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:01.790
You may be poison to Nya-tan.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:02.690
Poison?

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.570
Despite how she is, 
Nya-tan's my precious student.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.320
I can't just sit by and do nothin'.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:13.330
So...

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.670
Tomorrow, I'm gonna challenge 
Nya-tan to a battle.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:19.500
Depending on the outcome,

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:23.010
I'll take Nya-tan away from 
here on a training journey.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:24.170
Is that all right?

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.700
You don't have to ask me.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.550
Nya-tan made her own decision to live here.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:32.090
Oh, right... Having her here is 
a nuisance to you, isn't it?

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:35.730
I wouldn't say a nuisance... 
Well, sometimes it is...

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:36.610
Wait, what are you doing?!

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:39.690
Oh, sorry. I thought you'd 
feel bad if I left any.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.060
No, please, take it with you.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.780
Okay. Thanks.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:49.280
<b>Fun Wrap</b>

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:47.010
Uh, I'd appreciate it if you'd 
leave the plate, though.

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:49.280
Oh... Sorry.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.540
<i>Having her here is a nuisance 
to you, isn't it?</i>

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.330
<i>I wouldn't say a nuisance...</i>

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.470
Uri-tan, have you been here the whole time?

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:03.470
I sure have. I heard every word.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:04.500
I see.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.550
How do you really feel, Takeru-san?

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:08.950
Huh? About what?

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.720
About Nya-tan.

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.310
How do I feel? I'm not sure.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:17.060
Maybe it's not that you don't know, 
but that you're trying not to think about it?

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:20.130
What's this about, Uri-tan? 
You're digging pretty deep here.

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:22.230
It's something I've always wondered.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.930
Why do you tend to hide how you feel?

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:30.030
I hate it when feelings I gave a lot 
of thought to turn out to be wrong.

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:32.600
Anyway, goodnight.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:39.660
Feelings aren't something you 
have by thinking, Takeru-san.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:44.960
Nya-tan, wake up!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.270
Nya-tan!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.430
She's not in?

00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:51.720
Damn it, where'd she wander 
off to this early?

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.350
Nya-tan?

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.180
Where are ya?

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.100
Nya-tan!

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.590
Nya-ta—

00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:58.940
She won't find us this time!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:06:59.920
You think so?

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:01.810
Let's just get it over with.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.140
Got the goods?

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:05.110
Don't worry. I've got 'em.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.690
Not only that, but they're 
even better than last time!

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.950
Really?! Let's see! Let's see!

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.390
All right.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.200
<b>Legendary Bananas                   Aged Bone</b>

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.200
For real?!

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.060
Wow!

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:18.330
Don't rush, now. Did you 
bring what you promised?

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.200
Of course!

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:19.200
<b>Monkey                    Dog</b>

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:19.200
<b>Sol/Lull Seals</b>

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:21.580
All right then. This time—

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:25.460
Master!

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:28.430
You're tryin' to pull this again?

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:31.810
Well, I haven't been able 
to get any Sol/Lull Seals!

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.320
Nya-tan's under pressure!

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:33.930
Yeah!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.810
And I told you that gettin' 
Seals that way won't work!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:40.980
The rules say if I get twelve 
Seals, I can join the zodiac!

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:44.730
So I'll do whatever it takes 
to become one of them!

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.970
Just gettin' your hands on 
'em isn't all that matters.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:48.860
You're too serious, Master!

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:48.860
What?

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.920
Shouldn't you try to live more 
candidly, like you did before?

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.090
What're ya talkin' about?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:55.890
These!

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:57.410
Wh-What are those?!

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:05.080
Episode 5

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:00.270
I guess you guys don't remember, huh?

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:03.990
You acted a lot more freely when 
you were a leopardess, Master!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:08.250
Why do you have pictures of that?

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:10.010
Between you and me,

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:13.330
they sell quite high to 
customers at the café.

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:15.550
The personality contrast turns them on!

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.280
Ooh! Let me see!

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.240
Wow, sexy!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.300
I've got more.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:20.550
No way! That one's incredible!

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.080
Her boobs are huge!

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.230
Lucky! They're sexy and huge!

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.440
How about this one?

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:26.420
What is this?! It's crazy!

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:28.220
That's way too sexy!

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:29.080
Sexy!

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.070
Sexy!

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.900
It is, isn't it?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.910
What a disgrace! What despair!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.720
The shame of knowing I brought up a student

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.910
who'd blackmail her master like this!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.790
Uh, she's acting weird...

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.400
If it's come to this...

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.380
My aged bone!

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.590
What are you trying to do?!

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:52.210
Seppuku!

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:53.510
What?!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:56.640
I'll atone for all these 
disgraces with my life.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.140
But I'll be takin' y'all with me!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.430
What?!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.020
Stop! Stop!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.390
My aged bone!

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.660
Stop it!

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:13.860
Huh?

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.360
Even if you have lost your memories,

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.620
that kick was pathetic!

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:26.370
Ow!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.950
I thought that if you could

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:32.550
truly join the zodiac by your own strength,

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.240
I wouldn't mind retiring.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:38.040
But what was that kick?

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:38.930
I won't have it.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:42.260
We start trainin' right now! 
I'll start you over from scratch!

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.180
Training?!

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.720
Good luck, Nya-tan.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:46.420
Give our best to the sexy big-boobs master.

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:47.940
That goes for you slackers, too!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.150
Huh?!

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.900
So, what training are we doing?

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.340
We'll have a real battle 
for Sol/Lull Seals.

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.420
Key-tan, Inu-tan, 
you're fine with that, yes?

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:59.000
Y-Yes. We understand.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.330
Hmm... So that means...

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:05.200
If I win, I get three Seals at once, right?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:05.950
That's right.

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:08.210
All right! In that case...

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.460
I'll need this!

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:10.760
What's that?

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:14.190
Ta-da! My secret Sol/Lull stash!

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.130
Meow

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.140
It's shriveled!

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:16.890
How long have you had that?!

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:20.340
It's fine! That just means the 
energy in it has condensed!

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:21.720
All right, let's begin!

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:23.470
Start the battle!

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:23.470
<b>Approved</b>

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:26.810
Etotama! Sol/Lull Charge!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:25.810
<b>Tiger                              Cat</b>

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:25.810
<b>Monkey                              Dog</b>

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:44.700
Cat Eto-musume, Nya-tan!

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.120
Tiger Eto-shin,

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:50.620
Shima-tan!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:55.630
Monkey Eto-shin,

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.050
Key-tan!

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:02.000
Dog Eto-shin, Inu-tan!

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.900
It's begun.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:05.680
Yeah.

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:07.460
So it has.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:13.020
Monkey

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:13.020
I'm Key-tan!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:13.020
<b>Illustration: Toda Megumi</b>

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:13.020
<b>[Zodiac Precepts ~Article 5: Prohibitions] If a Sol/Lull Seal battle is approved, 
the Eto-shin determines the conditions for victory. 
Any falsehood, impropriety, or danger to humans is forbidden.</b>

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:17.990
<b>Eyecatch!</b>

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:17.990
Key and Inu are always together!!

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:17.990
<b>Illustration: Honda Mariko</b>

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:17.990
<b>Zodiac Precepts ~Article 6: Allowances] In a Sol/Lull 
Seal battle or setting of conditions for victory, 
any Eto-shin or Eto-musume may 
receive any sort of help from a human, 
as long as there is no danger to the human.</b>

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:31.670
Master!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.450
What are your rules?

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:35.660
The rule is...

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:44.600
A kick-the-can battle.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.220
Kick-the-can?

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:47.180
I'm "it."

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:51.100
Sesame Oil

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:50.680
Anyone who can kick this can 
away from me even once wins.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:51.780
Even once?!

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:53.400
Are you sure that's the rule you want?

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.060
No problem here.

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:56.900
That's just fine.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.810
Gather!

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:14.580
Hey, Nya-tan, why'd you make us gather?

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.750
If we don't take this seriously, 
we're gonna lose!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.830
I-It's a strategy meeting!

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:21.090
We'll all work together to win!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.590
I-Isn't that unfair?

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.930
If you can't win with strength, 
you fight with this!

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.550
It's a perfect strategy!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:32.600
She may be a master, but even she'll 
have trouble taking us all at once.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:34.600
You're right. Let's go with that.

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:38.270
Okay. I want to get this scary 
training battle over with quick.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.940
The important point is our teamwork.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:43.550
We've gotta be separate, but united.

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:45.610
Done with your strategy meeting?

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:53.770
Y'all are rarin' to go, huh?

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.040
Then...

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.690
Let's start the battle!

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:03.830
<i>While Master's distracted by 
the other two attacking,</i>

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:05.430
<i>I'll kick the can and win!</i>

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.650
Take this!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:23.900
Sneaky little tricks won't 
get you into the zodiac.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:25.580
Didn't I tell you that?

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:33.290
Sheesh...

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.410
<i>Try harder, you zodiac brats!</i>

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.750
No way. No way.

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.800
That's what I call an underdog.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:39.790
Shut up!

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:43.070
But there's still plenty of 
time left in the episode.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:45.290
You're saying stuff I don't 
understand again, but...

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:47.050
Is Shima-tan really that strong?

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:49.380
"Strong" doesn't even cover it.

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:52.180
There's a reason she's the master 
of strength and techniques.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.220
Shima-tan is one of the

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:57.560
four strongest Eto-shin.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:00.190
Why four? That's kinda vague.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:04.830
What, they both surrendered already?

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.750
They really are slackin' as zodiac gods.

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:10.160
That saves ya some trouble.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:13.480
If you can kick this can, you get 'em both.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.160
Here I come!

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:19.720
I hit it!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:25.340
This won't work! I need to 
throw her off-balance!

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:38.030
You haven't gotten any of 
your strength back at all.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.490
In fact, you've gotten weaker.

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.320
Master...

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:46.000
At this rate, Chu-tan really will beat you!

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:01.040
Chu-tan...

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:03.110
Are you going to Nya-tan?

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:07.550
Can't you just leave her alone now?

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:11.550
You saw it in your battle 
with her, didn't you?

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:15.560
Nya-tan was eliminated 60 years ago,

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.560
and she reincarnated...

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:21.400
But she's lost all her memories and powers.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.830
My soul cries out,

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.050
"Destroy the cat clan."

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:31.990
Nya-tan is not the same 
Nya-tan she was then!

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:36.080
If you insist on fighting her, 
I'll stop you as many times as it takes!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.330
What do you people think

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.870
the strictly impartial ETM12 is?

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.340
You can't stop me any longer.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:47.880
I have submitted a thirteenth 
article to the Zodiac Precepts.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:49.630
What?!

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:53.020
You've added a new article 
to the Zodiac Precepts,

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.510
the rules of the ETM12?

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.750
Intervention in a battle

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:59.770
by a third party will never again be permitted.

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:08.610
You won't interfere.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:09.610
Chu-tan!

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:14.660
What is that sinister Sol/Lull?

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:16.490
Still...

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:19.140
The Zodiac Precepts that have been upheld,

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:21.290
unchanged, for 2,000 years...

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:23.530
But there's still time before

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:25.670
her new precept is enforced.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.800
Until then, Chu-tan shouldn't be 
able to do anything, either.

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:30.340
I must do something...

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:38.390
<i>No good...</i>

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.670
I'm going to end this now, Nya-tan.

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:48.510
And then you're going to 
leave Takeru's house!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:51.580
Why does it have to come to that?!

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:55.050
Leaving you with Takeru will only 
make you weaker and weaker.

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:57.040
You just rely on him and 
think frivolous thoughts...

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.410
That's not true!

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.920
Since I met Takeru, I've had all kinds of

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.080
experiences and learned lots of things!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:05.120
Experiences? Learned?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.130
Like what?!

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:08.960
Like what? A lot!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.560
I've made lots of memories with Takeru...

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.860
Memories that make me...

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.530
So many memories...

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.330
L-Lots of memories...

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.620
I don't have that many memories!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:42.160
That's only natural. 
We're not that deeply connected.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:46.170
Takeru-san, wouldn't you be 
sad if Nya-tan went away?

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.290
Sad? I don't know...

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:52.030
I don't think I would.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.920
Hurry up and surrender, Nya-tan.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:59.180
Come with me to train and 
start over from scratch!

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:00.260
No!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.430
Why are ya so against the idea?

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:04.650
You don't have any memories here!

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:05.930
I don't now,

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.770
but I'm going to make lots

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:11.620
and lots of them!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:18.660
Is that only because ya want Sol/Lull?

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.660
Because ya wanna use the human

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.450
who happens to be here 
to achieve your goal?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:27.460
Well, that is certainly a 
clever way of thinking.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.850
In that case, you'll have 
to use him to the fullest

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:31.960
and take as much Sol/Lull as you can.

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:36.220
Treat him not as a human, 
but as a battery full of Sol/Lull!

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:37.330
No!

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:39.260
I don't want that!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.760
Takeru's Sol/Lull comes from

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.260
his own kind heart.

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:46.650
Takeru produces such amazing

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:49.710
Sol/Lull because he is who he is!

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:52.660
I've forgotten a lot of things.

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:55.440
I don't even remember why I wanted to

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.110
join the zodiac in the first place, but—

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:03.500
Wh-When I'm with Takeru,

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.450
sesame oil tastes better,

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.290
hot baths feel nicer,

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:11.040
and breakfast and trips out of the 
house and everything else is fun!

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:13.380
It's because Takeru is with me

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:17.260
that I can give all I've got to making my 
dream of joining the zodiac come true!

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.310
He's not a battery!

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:21.760
I can believe that because he's Takeru!

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:29.780
What makes you think

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:33.150
you can say I'm nice and all 
that other weird stuff?

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:35.820
You really are a nuisance.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:37.250
Takeru-san...

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.070
But...

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:41.820
You're a nuisance, but... I guess it's fun.

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:45.600
You say some real admirable things.

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:48.340
But if you can't beat me,

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:51.810
you won't get anywhere, let alone 
become one of the zodiac.

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:55.670
This is over.

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:58.020
That's why I...

00:19:58.610 --> 00:20:00.310
Don't want to lose.

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:02.360
I will win!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:07.180
Look what a mess you are...

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:10.600
You're making me want to cheer you on.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.190
<i>Nya-tan, hang in there!</i>

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:19.010
This is...

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:23.200
Here I come,

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.030
Master!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.030
<b>Cat</b>

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:29.700
Cat clan secret technique!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.050
Neko Masshiguran!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.050
<b>Neko Masshiguran</b>

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:49.770
<i>Nya-tan...</i>

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.200
<i>Go!</i>

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.950
<i>The battle is over.</i>

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.170
I see.

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:26.640
So Takeru did that... Now it makes sense.

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:27.540
Yep, yep.

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:30.820
An Eto-musume ignites a human's 
affections, and receives Sol/Lull.

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:33.140
There's no problem with 
that relationship at all.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:34.690
That's true.

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:37.650
I never expected her to let loose

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.900
a new move there, though.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.730
I got three more

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:47.750
Sol/Lull Seals...

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:50.480
You were great. Good job.

00:21:55.800 --> 00:21:57.500
Everything's looking good.

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:00.660
Hey, don't keep watchin' like that.

00:22:00.660 --> 00:22:01.960
Yep, yep, okay.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:47.280
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:37.200
For the monkey...

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:39.390
...and the dog folks of the Chinese zodiac!

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:42.140
Those born in the year of the 
monkey should eat lots and lots!

00:23:42.140 --> 00:23:45.130
And those born in the year of the 
dog should eat lots and lots, too!

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:47.050
I agree!

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:49.170
Next time: A Long, Serpentine Fate.

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>A Long, Serpentine Fate</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>The Carnivore</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Tiger</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Illustration: Tatsumi Yuiko</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Hope Ya Watch Again Next Week!</b>
